Maintainer: Thallium Project <36neelansh@gmail.com>
# cargo comes from rustup in CI, not Build-Depends: trixie's rustc 1.85 is
# older than this crate needs (let chains, File::lock).
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/thallium-os/autoterm

Package: autoterm
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Typo correction for unknown commands in fish and bash
 Corrects mistyped commands (sduo -> sudo, gti -> git) by edit distance
 over $PATH, builtins and functions. Read-only commands are fixed
 silently; anything else asks first. Learns from accepted, rejected and
 overridden corrections, kept in a checksummed per-user audit log.
 .
 fish loads it automatically; bash users source
 /usr/share/autoterm/autoterm.bash from ~/.bashrc.
